title: Discard every change with staged, unstaged, a staged deletion, a staged new file and untracked files: tracked files are as committed, untracked files survive (the staged new file: see the report)
folders: git-mixed
expect-file: git-mixed/a.txt :: ^a1\na2\na3\n$
expect-file: git-mixed/b.txt :: ^b1\nb2\nb3\n$
expect-file: git-mixed/gone.txt :: ^gone\n$
expect-file: git-mixed/untracked.txt :: nobody knows me
expect-file: git-mixed/sub/also untracked.txt :: nor me
forbid-log: script: ignoring
forbid-log: nothing offers

wait 3000
left changes
wait 500
mark before
wait 500
git discard
wait 600
mark asked
wait 500
answer Discard
wait 1500
mark end
wait 500
quit
